/
/POSITION COMMAND SEEN TO REGIS
/ACCEPT THE INCOMING DATA UNTIL A NEW COMMAND IS SEEN AT WHICH POINT A RETURN
/TO THE MAIN LEVEL IS DONE TO ACCEPT THE NEW COMMAND.
