/WOPV - WRITE OPTION OVERLAY ROUTINE
/
WOPV,	0
	
	CLA
	DCA	SETWR+1		/SAVE IT
	JMS	SETWRT		/SEND THE CMD TO THE TERM

	JMP I 	WOPV

