	TAD I	10		/SCAN THE TABLE FOR A MATCH
	CDF	RGFLD
	SNA			/SKIP IF NOT THE END OF THE TABLE
	JMP	GETCOA		/TRY THE NEXT VALUE.
	TAD	LOOK1		/SEE IF IT IS THIS ONE (CONVERTED CHARACTER)
	SZA CLA			/SKIP IF A MATCH IS FOUND
