UPER,	0
/
	DCA	UPETM		/SAVE CHAR
	TAD	UPETM
	TAD	(-141		/LOWER CASE A TO Z
	SPA			/SKIP IF IT STILL LOOKS GOOD
	JMP	UPER8		/NOT LOWER CASE
	TAD	(-32		/THE RANGE OF CHARACTERS
	SMA CLA			/SKIP IF WITHIN RANGE
	JMP	UPER8		/NOT LOWER CASE CHARACTER
	TAD	UPETM		/MAKE IT UPPERCASE
	TAD	(-40		/THIS DOES IT
	DCA	UPETM		/SAVE FOR RETURN
/
UPER8,	CLA CLL
	TAD	UPETM		/GET CONVERTED CHAR
	JMP I	UPER		/RETURN WITH CHAR, NOW UPPER-CASE


