	CLL CLA IAC R3L		/SET UP BYTE COUNT TO WRITE
	TAD	STMAC5
	CLL RAL			/*2 FOR FINAL RESULT
	IAC			/ONE MORE TO COMPENSATE FOR THE TERMINATOR
	CIA
	DCA	10
